prompt:
REDRAW the reference as a more spacious transparent sprite sheet for Juniper Vale's double dunk. Keep the same 15-pose two-pump sequence, canon identity and art style, but scale each figure uniformly to about 85% of the current figure size, centered in its grid cell. Make a clear 5-column by 3-row grid and leave at least 24px transparent space above/below every silhouette and at least 24px on both sides. No hair, fingertip, shoe or limb may approach the canvas boundary. In particular move/scale pose3 lower enough that its highest fingertip is at least32px below the canvas top. Keep clear gutters so no adjacent poses touch.

Critical: all hands must be empty. Do not draw a basketball, ball, circle, sphere, seam, glow, prop or object in ANY pose. For carries poses0–9, show Juniper's two hands curved around visibly empty transparent air, with an open gap between them and no filled area or object. Poses10–14 are also empty-handed after the only release.

Juniper identity: compact human woman, warm light skin, focused dark eyes, high dark-purple curly ponytail with gold tie, blank Chicago Condas purple-and-gold jersey/shorts with no writing, dark knee pads, white socks, purple-and-gold shoes. Exactly15 unique complete in-bounds poses, row-major:
0 approach with two hands cupped around empty air at abdomen;
1 plant and sink, empty hands gather at chest;
2 takeoff with empty cradle rising to forehead;
3 first overhead pump, arms extend while curved fingers remain empty;
4 elbows fold and hands return toward face;
5 empty hands re-secure at upper chest;
6 second gather dips to sternum;
7 highest point with empty cradle low at chest;
8 second pump drives hands past forehead;
9 arms extend overhead, open space between palms;
10 one simultaneous finger release, both wrists snap down; no object;
11 long twin-arm follow-through;
12 empty elbows flex outward as hands drop;
13 landing approach with arms open sideways;
14 balanced two-foot landing with arms down.
No grid lines, captions, background, court, hoop, shadow or accessories. Match the reference face, natural anatomy, hairstyle, kit and crisp arcade pixel-art shading.

